WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Open Order history → View order → Delivery tracking.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Step 2: Use Confirm ordered for stock actually ordered externally or not confirmed by the sending service, and enter its expected date.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Step 3: Use Change delivery date to correct an outstanding estimate.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Step 4: When every item from that supplier arrives, choose Mark received, check the items and press Confirm received.
